WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.096
A recursive query is easier to understand if you
simulate it Iteration

00:00:06.123 --> 00:00:11.874
zero returns the anchor The next iteration finds
direct reports

00:00:13.607 --> 00:00:19.192
The following iteration finds reports of those
employees When no new

00:00:19.206 --> 00:00:25.124
child rows match recursion stops This mental model
helps you debug

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.413
the join relationship
